{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22219","headline":"题元十八溪亭 · 白居易","name":"题元十八溪亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"怪君不喜仕，又不游州里。\n今日到幽居，了然知所以。\n宿君石溪亭，潺湲声满耳。\n饮君螺杯酒，醉卧不能起。\n见君五老峰，益悔居城市。\n爱君三男儿，始叹身无子。\n余方鑪峰下，结室爲居士。\n山北与山东，往来从此始。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22219.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22219","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}